ri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593995458_1430430158625470_7993625367337607335_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DacmHQvCTI4Q7kNvwFurUyI&_nc_oc=AdoUTmhCMEBPzLwyXRQXQc9tU66KXxKFju-YHNIMhu2WQG-Ums_iBuZgAsngIWcE-0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRWsQueSeukdrtUS_mOf_6v8BOAVMYbwdSE6zhoVikhTQ&oe=6AFC706B"}, "display_name": "Blooming Conductor", "keywords": ["cozy", "conduct", "rhythm", "garden", "hand"], "long_description": "Join our Discord: https://discord.gg/TDZyp9JWw5\n\n**A world waits to bloom, and your hands are the magic. \ud83c\udf38**\n\nBlooming Conductor is a cozy hand-tracking rhythm game. No controllers, no fail states, no grind. Just raise your hands, follow the music,  and let the world bloom around you.\n{2148677402692887}\n\n**\ud83c\udfbc Conduct with your bare hands**\n\nPoke, wave and raise to the beat of timeless classics, from *Danse Macabre* to *In the Hall of the Mountain King* and a rock-flavored *Canon in D*.\n\n**\u2728 Every song, a different world**\n\nEach song takes you to its own magical environment, with a distinct atmosphere and plants that dance to the music. Earn seeds and pots, then plant and nurture a garden that's all yours.\n{1221504483532481}\n\n**\ud83d\udc50 Four ways to play every song**\n\nChoose your difficulty: Easy or Hard.\nChoose your hand mode: Free Hands or Assigned Hands.\nMix and match for four combinations on every song.\n\n**\ud83c\udfe1 Make yourself comfortable**\n\nPlay sitting or standing, in full VR or mixed reality right in your room.\n{4234811450152341}\n\n**\ud83d\udc23 Meet Sprouty**\n\nYour little companion, guiding you through every bloom.\n\n**\ud83d\udea7 Early Access: growing with you**\n- **Now:** 5 songs in the kingdom of Darkling Tor, 4 ways to play each\n- **Planned for November:** A festive update with new seasonal surprises!\n- **Planned for full release in Spring 2027** 16 songs including a second kingdom (Pyro Isle), more seeds, plants and garden features\n{962132703175522}\n\n**\ud83d\udcac Join our Discord**\n\nPlay new builds first, share feedback, and help decide what blooms next.\n\ud83d\udc49 https://discord.gg/TDZyp9JWw5\n\nEnjoying the journey? Please leave a review. It helps our garden grow!\n\n{4530356283872683}", "short_description": "Blooming Conductor is a cozy hand-tracking rhythm game in Early Access: Conduct music with your bare hands and make magical plants grow and dance around you.\nNew songs and a second kingdom are on the way.\nJoin our Discord to play and share your feedback: https://discord.gg/TDZyp9JWw5"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1484143696923837", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blooming Conductor", "keywords": ["conductor", "cozy", "rhythm", "hand", "garden"], "long_description": "Join our Discord: https://discord.gg/TDZyp9JWw5\n\n**A world waits to bloom, and your hands are the magic. \ud83c\udf38**\n\nBlooming Conductor is a cozy hand-tracking rhythm game. No controllers, no fail states, no grind. Just raise your hands, follow the music,  and let the world bloom around you.\n{1529399342374776}\n\n**\ud83c\udfbc Conduct with your bare hands**\n\nPoke, wave and raise to the beat of timeless classics, from *Danse Macabre* to *In the Hall of the Mountain King* and a rock-flavored *Canon in D*.\n\n**\u2728 Every song, a different world**\n\nEach song takes you to its own magical environment, with a distinct atmosphere and plants that dance to the music. Earn seeds and pots, then plant and nurture a garden that's all yours.\n{1478935214162571}\n\n**\ud83d\udc50 Four ways to play every song**\n\nChoose your difficulty: Easy or Hard.\nChoose your hand mode: Free Hands or Assigned Hands.\nMix and match for four combinations on every song.\n\n**\ud83c\udfe1 Make yourself comfortable**\n\nPlay sitting or standing, in full VR or mixed reality right in your room.\n{1473733434653377}\n\n**\ud83d\udc23 Meet Sprouty**\n\nYour little companion, guiding you through every bloom.\n\n**\ud83d\udea7 Early Access: growing with you**\n- **Now:** 5 songs in the kingdom of Darkling Tor, 4 ways to play each\n- **Planned for November:** A festive update with new seasonal surprises!\n- **Planned for full release in Spring 2027** 16 songs including a second kingdom (Pyro Isle), more seeds, plants and garden features.\n\n{996343160202909}\n\n**\ud83d\udcac Join our Discord**\n\nPlay new builds first, share feedback, and help decide what blooms next.\n\ud83d\udc49 https://discord.gg/TDZyp9JWw5\n\nEnjoying the journey? Please leave a review. It helps our garden grow!\n{1943087773333857}\n\n", "short_description": "Blooming Conductor is a cozy hand-tracking rhythm game in Early Access: Conduct music with your bare hands and make magical plants grow and dance around you.\nNew songs and a second kingdom are on the way.\nJoin our Discord to play and share your feedback: https://discord.gg/TDZyp9JWw5"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1139570841755943", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blooming Conductor", "keywords": ["\u97f3\u30b2\u30fc", "\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30c8\u30e9\u30c3\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0", "\u30af\u30e9\u30b7\u30c3\u30af\u97f3\u697d", "\u30ac\u30fc\u30c7\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0", "\u7652\u3057"], "long_description": "**\u82b1\u54b2\u304f\u4e16\u754c\u3078\u3002\u9b54\u6cd5\u306f\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u624b\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u3002\ud83c\udf38**\n\n\u300eBlooming Conductor\u300f\u306f\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u624b\u3067\u97f3\u697d\u3092\u594f\u3067\u3001\u4e16\u754c\u306b\u82b1\u3092\u54b2\u304b\u305b\u308b\u30ea\u30e9\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u7cfb\u30ea\u30ba\u30e0\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3002\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u3082\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30aa\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u3082\u3001\u9762\u5012\u306a\u4f5c\u696d\u3082\u306a\u3057\u3002\u4e21\u624b\u30