e2.png", "id": "1014036374498431", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604275479_1014036377831764_1799004412242611496_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=szS4gC7UlTcQ7kNvwHrEx9s&_nc_oc=AdrieYi85rG0YkcdkbpQok3Ys4t4g0UFXmPgp6QCTnGC9aUJcKnBAT1OLoa2kZiIR_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT-0qibQBKr3-uVHkk0vjR6PKNLiqwQ8n4cruG_Zq6_yg&oe=6AFC65D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blooming Conductor", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Blooming Conductor: A Hand-Tracking VR Rhythm Adventure\n\nWhat if music could make nature bloom?\n\nStep into the next generation of spatial computing with Blooming Conductor, an immersive VR music game where your hands hold the power of creation. Experience a world where every gesture breathes life into the earth.\n\nLeave your controllers behind\u2014this is a pure hand-tracking experience designed for the ultimate freedom of movement on Meta Quest 3, Quest 3S, and Quest Pro.\n\n--- KEY FEATURES ---\n\n100% Controller-Free Gameplay: Optimized for the latest gesture control technology. No buttons, no triggers\u2014just the intuitive flow of your own hands.\n\nIntuitive Musical Gestures: Master the art of botanical conducting. Use a Poke to spark growth, Wave to guide swaying vines, and Raise your Palms to summon soaring melodies.\n\nSpatial Gardening (MR Mode): Collect rare seeds and musical energy to decorate your real-world room in a stunning Mixed Reality (MR) experience.\n\nMeet Sprouty: Your whimsical companion, Sprouty, will guide you through this relaxing world, helping you uncover hidden musical wonders and magical secrets.\n\n--- Planned for 2026 Full Release ---\n\nEarly Access: This is a core-mechanic demo. Your feedback is vital! Help us shape the future of spatial music as we grow toward our 2026 launch.\n\nPerfect for fans of relaxing VR, rhythm action, and anyone looking to experience the magic of controller-free VR.", "short_description": "Conduct nature into bloom with your hands!\nBlooming Conductor is a VR rhythm experience designed exclusively for Hand Tracking. Ditch the controllers and use your bare hands to conduct magical flora. Watch as vibrant plants grow, sway, and dance to your every gesture in a living musical ecosystem.\n\nNote: This is an early-stage demo showcasing our core hand-tracking mechanics. Be among the first to test our core conducting mechanics as we prepare for our 2026 full release."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bloomingconductor.infinutshell.studio/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "InfiNutshell Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bloomingconductor.infinutshell.studio/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28179683618289051"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1107324642169117"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1077465804662336"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1077465804662336"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1797271200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1107324642169117"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "